---
// /ecology — the research ecology's one entrance (v3, 2026-08-30 — the shared question).
//
// What stood here before was the pyramid entrance of 2026-08-12 (EcologyEntrance.astro).
// Research ecology v3 retired the order that surface narrated — seasons of gates, the
// machine-advantage bar, the reading countdown — so keeping it as the entrance would have
// been the site telling yesterday's story (the drift the Aktualitäts-Regel forbids).
//
// Git is the archive: EcologyEntrance.astro and its wording stay in the repo, unlinked,
// exactly as the anatomy page did when the pyramid replaced it. The approval trail is
// docs/decision-log.md, 2026-08-30, and docs/design/2026-08-30-research-ecology-v3.md.
//
// 2026-10-11: the entrance became a SCORE (design handoff docs/design_handoff_homepage_ecology/
// README.md §4) — every night since v3 as a bar, every session a notehead, every relation the
// Middle recorded a slur, on the paper ground the site's entrance took the same day.
// EcologyV3Entrance.astro stays in the repo, unlinked, as its predecessors did.
import Page from '@/layouts/Page.astro'
import EcologyScore from '@/components/ecology/score/EcologyScore.astro'
import { ECOLOGY_V3 } from '@/config/ecology-v3-wording'

const SEO = ECOLOGY_V3.seo
---

<Page title={`${SEO.title} | Frank Bültge`} description={SEO.description} surface="paper">
  <EcologyScore />
</Page>
